# Large generated files
*.html
!apps/scraper-console/public/**/*.html
!apps/web/public/**/*.html
# 例外：设计稿预览需入库。仓库曾因缺这条丢过文件。
!docs/design/**/*.html
# 例外：洞察报告包与报告构建源必须入库。导入器按字节校验 report.html。
!tools/insight-reports/**/*.html
!insight_pipeline/**/*.html

